# tig light colors — sourced by .tigrc through the theme-active.tigrc symlink,
# which toggle_theme.sh flips. Only what cannot be shared with the dark theme
# belongs here; everything mode-agnostic stays in .tigrc.

# The cursor line and the focused view's title bar, exactly what .tigrc carried
# before the split: under the light theme (Ghostty + Catppuccin Latte) ANSI blue
# is a strong #1e66f5, so white bold text on it reads at 4.91:1 and needs no
# help. Listed explicitly so both modes declare the same set of areas.
color cursor      white blue bold
color title-focus white blue bold
